Package: test
Type: Package
Title: Label Whacky Vessel Positions (Review Copy)
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
  person("Einar", "Hjörleifsson", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "einar.hjorleifsson@gmail.com")
  )
Description: A review copy of the whacky-position filter rb_whack_clean(). It
    labels implausible positions in vessel tracks (AIS, VMS) with a speed-distance-angle filter after Freitas et al.
    (2008), followed by a forward speed scan, and never drops a row. Works on a
    data frame and on a lazy DuckDB table. Includes rb_whack_duplicates(), which
    flags near-duplicate reports from merged feeds, to run before it.
